<Slide style={{
    width: 1280,
    height: 720,
    background: '#F8FAFC',
    padding: '28px 60px',
    display: 'flex',
    flexDirection: 'column',
    justifyContent: 'space-between'
}}>
    {/* A区：标题栏 */}
    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'center' }}>
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 2 }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 30, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E3A8A' }}>
                总结展望 · 聚微光筑童心：让青春在基层绽放
            </Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#64748B' }}>
                篇章四 · 未来规划与示范辐射 · 青年担当与健康中国
            </Text>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ background: '#EFF6FF', padding: '5px 12px', borderRadius: 6, border: '1px solid #BFDBFE' }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 12, color: '#1D4ED8', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>
                🚀 发展蓝图
            </Text>
        </Box>
    </Box>

    {/* B区：阶梯式发展规划 */}
    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 16 }}>
        {/* 阶段 1 */}
        <Box style={{
            flex: 1,
            background: '#FFFFFF',
            borderRadius: 10,
            padding: '20px 18px',
            border: '1px solid #E2E8F0',
            boxShadow: '0 4px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.03)',
            flexDirection: 'column',
            gap: 10
        }}>
            <Box style={{ background: '#E0F2FE', padding: '4px 10px', borderRadius: 4, width: 75 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 12, color: '#0369A1', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>近期 · 深耕</Text>
            </Box>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0F172A' }}>
                模型微调与端侧迭代
            </Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 12, color: '#64748B', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>
                • 优化 AI 健身教练的动作库与少儿骨骼发育适配算法<br />
                • 完善离线打卡徽章与家长端体质周报生成能力
            </Text>
        </Box>

        {/* 阶段 2 */}
        <Box style={{
            flex: 1,
            background: '#FFFFFF',
            borderRadius: 10,
            padding: '20px 18px',
            border: '1px solid #E2E8F0',
            boxShadow: '0 4px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.03)',
            flexDirection: 'column',
            gap: 10
        }}>
            <Box style={{ background: '#FEF3C7', padding: '4px 10px', borderRadius: 4, width: 75 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 12, color: '#92400E', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>中期 · 扩面</Text>
            </Box>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0F172A' }}>
                全省高校志愿联盟辐射
            </Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 12, color: '#64748B', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>
                • 依托开源项目向全省乃至全国更多高校志愿队伍推广<br />
                • 联合基层团委打造“百个社区以动代屏示范驿站”
            </Text>
        </Box>

        {/* 阶段 3 */}
        <Box style={{
            flex: 1,
            background: '#FFFFFF',
            borderRadius: 10,
            padding: '20px 18px',
            border: '1px solid #E2E8F0',
            boxShadow: '0 4px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.03)',
            flexDirection: 'column',
            gap: 10
        }}>
            <Box style={{ background: '#DCFCE7', padding: '4px 10px', borderRadius: 4, width: 75 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 12, color: '#166534', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>远期 · 融合</Text>
            </Box>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0F172A' }}>
                体教融合智慧生态
            </Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 12, color: '#64748B', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>
                • 接入地方全民健身大数据平台，赋能基层公共卫生体系<br />
                • 持续贡献青年智慧，书写“健康中国”青春答卷
            </Text>
        </Box>
    </Box>

    {/* C区：页脚 */}
    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'center', borderTop: '1px solid #E2E8F0', paddingTop: 10 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 12, color: '#94A3B8' }}>童健韶华 · 青少年体质提升与数字赋能行动</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 12, color: '#94A3B8' }}>14 / 15</Text>
    </Box>
</Slide>
